{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:06 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:06 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:06 2026-11-27 HKT</p><img alt=\"黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d76b31d18b5579712cdea78cb99fe4b9/2026-11/2026-11-27_00_02_16_0.png\"/><p>影響廣東沿岸的東北季候風正在緩和。而覆蓋該區的雲帶亦逐漸轉薄。</p><p>本港地區今日初時部分時間多雲。日間漸轉天晴，市區最高氣溫約25度，新界再高一兩度。吹輕微至和緩北至東北風。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af54e3bdf233f1952b5d376b421785da/2026-11/2026-11-26_23_59_51.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d37aec1ebf7d157717b71aca1d18c9af/2026-11/2026-11-27_00_00_01.png\"/><img alt=\"日間漸轉天晴，市區最高氣溫約25度，新界再高一兩度。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a81645be91493d7c6511cbe92580c48/2026-11/1_4_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"日間漸轉天晴，市區最高氣溫約25度，新界再高一兩度。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/304416cba0d41c5ed73b358acd6fd151/2026-11/2_0_15.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"日間漸轉天晴，市區最高氣溫約25度，新界再高一兩度。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1da6b8e5e5a1cf8b758af9693f6b21f/2026-11/3_3_14.jpeg\"/><p>展望週末期間至下週初大致天晴。星期六非常乾燥。星期日風勢頗大。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:03:53.059265+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T00:06:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T03:37:29.640413+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T02:57:32.444410+00:00","content_hash":"8be14c5e95b26ba3104d05a6eb19ddff48f06a1735f30d7919db0cad71a92813","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}